Package: kdif
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), git
Recommends: kicad (>= 7)
Maintainer: MuratovAS <muratovas@0x12.net>
Homepage: https://github.com/0x12net/kdif
Description: interactive HTML diff viewer for KiCad boards and schematics
 kdif generates a single self-contained interactive HTML file showing the diff
 of a KiCad board and schematic between git revisions. It drives kicad-cli and
 reads the revisions from the project's git repository. The same tool is also
 installable inside KiCad through the Plugin and Content Manager, which is
 packaged separately (see the project homepage).
